# Environment and secrets
.env
tmp/

# The handoff note stays on this machine. It is the working picture of one
# person's desktop, and it names the machine, the drive and the build. Gova
# decided on 2026-09-22 that it must not reach the remote; it was purged from
# the whole history at the same time, before the first push.
